tion works and explain which configuration change resolved the issue. If the application requires persistent data, verify that the data remains available after replacing the container.\n\n## 12. Interview and Engineering Understanding\n\nAn engineer should be able to explain what **Maven Profiles — Dependency Resolution** means, why Docker uses the relevant capability, which components participate, how the operation works, and how the result is verified.\n\nA strong practical answer describes the initial state, the exact Docker configuration or commands, the resulting image or container behavior, the evidence collected, and the production risks. Avoid simply listing commands. Explain what each command changes, which component performs the work, and how the final application behavior is confirmed."
